# Measure rhCortex, rhCortexVol, Right hemisphere cortical gray matter volume, 225000.000000, mm^3
# Measure Cortex, CortexVol, Total cortical gray matter volume, 445000.000000, mm^3
# Measure SubCortGray, SubCortGrayVol, Subcortical gray matter volume, 55000.000000, mm^3
# Measure TotalGray, TotalGrayVol, Total gray matter volume, 600000.000000, mm^3
# Measure SupraTentorial, SupraTentorialVol, Supratentorial volume, 980000.000000, mm^3
# Measure Mask, MaskVol, Mask Volume, 1600000.000000, mm^3
